* Task 10 fixture: DEFINE DATA with multiple section keywords
* Exercises LOCAL, PARAMETER, and GLOBAL USING sections with fields per section.

DEFINE DATA
LOCAL
1 #LOCAL-COUNTER (N5)
1 #LOCAL-NAME (A30)
PARAMETER
1 #INPUT-VALUE (N9.2)
1 #OUTPUT-RESULT (A50)
GLOBAL USING EMPLOYEES-GDA
END-DEFINE

END
